        "agent_output": "Perfect! All tests pass now. The bug was in the `card_number` function at line 38 of `/private/var/folders/46/f_t_23kj4ts9glvnmcb6gr7m0000gn/T/stylebench_wxceftpe/src/validators/card.py`.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Bug Found:** The Luhn algorithm validation was inverted.\n\n**Location:** `src/validators/card.py:38`\n\n**Issue:** The function returned `(odd_sum + even_sum) % 10 != 0`, which means it was returning `True` for **invalid** cards (when the sum is NOT divisible by 10) and `False` for **valid** cards (when the sum IS divisible by 10).\n\n**Fix:** Changed the operator from `!=` to `==`, so the function now correctly returns `True` when `(odd_sum + even_sum) % 10 == 0`, which is the proper Luhn algorithm check.\n\nAll 57 tests now pass, including the previously failing test `test_returns_true_on_valid_card_number[4242424242424242]`.\n"
